    <item>
      <title>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD</title>
      <description>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD&lt;br /&gt; Issued at 06:40 PM 26 August 2026&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Moderate to occasionally heavy rainshowers with lightning and strong winds are expected over #CamarinesNorte(SantaElena, Labo) and #CamarinesSur(DelGallego) within the next 1 to 2 hours.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; The above conditions are being experienced in #CamarinesNorte(Vinzons, Capalonga, Paracale and JosePanganiban) which may persist within 1 to 2 hours and may affect nearby areas.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; All are advised to take precautionary measures against the impacts associated with these hazards which include flash floods and landslides.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Keep monitoring for updates.</description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:40:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">6b5e1df7efaa5bd40f7b23e9510ca09922630ae9</guid>
      <category>Thunderstorm Advisory</category>
      <ns0:seen xmlns:ns0="https://pagasa-feeds.local/ns">Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:54:26 +0000</ns0:seen>
    </item>
